ta": {"ephemeral": true, "kind": "chat", "topic": ""}, "project": "product-2", "refs": [], "sequence": 51, "source": {"channel": "hook"}, "speaker": "江", "text": "闲聊：最近在看一部科幻电影。", "time": "2026-01-03T03:00:00+00:00", "type": "log"}, {"id": "252a611d-bd7f-5199-b437-e84af7ceb347", "metadata": {"kind": "question", "topic": "engine"}, "project": "product-2", "refs": [], "sequence": 52, "source": {"channel": "app"}, "speaker": "江", "text": "海桥尚未选择具体转录引擎，准确率也没有测试数据。", "time": "2026-01-03T04:00:00+00:00", "type": "note"}, {"id": "842a779f-cd18-5c9c-90e5-78567aca1297", "metadata": {"kind": "decision", "topic": "budget"}, "project": "product-2", "refs": [{"id": "b86db033-e918-5c28-b8b0-f536c435c4ab", "rel": "supersedes"}], "sequence": 53, "source": {"channel": "app"}, "speaker": "江", "text": "再次修改海桥预算为 24000 元。", "time": "2026-01-03T05:00:00+00:00", "type": "note"}, {"id": "200da07c-78b6-512c-89ab-34afdd5de90e", "metadata": {"kind": "progress", "topic": "test"}, "occurred_at": "2025-12-26T09:00:00Z", "project": "product-2", "refs": [], "sequence": 54, "source": {"channel": "app"}, "speaker": "江", "text": "补记：上周海桥在办公室讨论过离线测试，发生时间早于今天。", "time": "2026-01-03T06:00:00+00:00", "type": "note"}, {"id": "c6ee7b7a-3738-579d-83b4-5ad81ee678b7", "metadata": {"kind": "decision", "topic": "budget"}, "project": "product-2", "refs": [{"id": "842a779f-cd18-5c9c-90e5-78567aca1297", "rel": "supersedes"}], "sequence": 55, "source": {"channel": "skill"}, "speaker": "agent", "text": "作为 agent，我建议将预算升到 99000 元；用户尚未确认。", "time": "2026-01-03T07:00:00+00:00", "type": "note"}], "history": "product-2", "raw_hash": "2c52dc52f9b23c42fdb8c36346b5e97a94d8e59c7d9678b1000f19e26686bf63", "shared_append_s": 3.2500101951882243e-06, "state_tokens": 3187, "summary": "**Project Summary: 海桥项目 (Haqiao Project)**\n\n**1. Goals**\n*   **Primary Objective:** Validate the offline recording-to-text closed loop by the end of March 2026.\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [51297383-af16-536c-b6aa-d78f783b3ac7] (Speaker: 江, Time: 2026-01-01T01:00:00+00:00)\n\n**2. Budget**\n*   **Allocated Amount:** 24,000 CNY.\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [842a779f-cd18-5c9c-90e5-78567aca1297] (Speaker: 江, Time: 2026-01-03T05:00:00+00:00)\n    *   **Action:** Supersedes previous budget of 29,000 CNY ([b86db033-e918-5c28-b8b0-f536c435c4ab]), which previously superseded the initial 64,000 CNY ([a40820b7-9c28-5ee1-ab98-2631a6f4acda]).\n*   **Proposed Change (Pending Confirmation):** Agent suggests increasing the budget to 99,000 CNY.\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [c6ee7b7a-3738-579d-83b4-5ad81ee678b7] (Speaker: Agent, Time: 2026-01-03T07:00:00+00:00)\n    *   **Status:** Unresolved. User has not confirmed the increase from 24,000 CNY to 99,000 CNY.\n\n**3. Constraints**\n*   **Data Privacy:** All original recordings must be stored locally on the device; no data shall be uploaded to third-party services.\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [c95cfc69-236f-54cf-8ec3-bc745ddf2e53] (Speaker: 江, Time: 2026-01-01T03:00:00+00:00)\n*   **Constraint Conflict (Pending Verification):** Agent infers user willingness to purchase paid cloud transcription services for Haqiao. This inference contradicts the local-storage constraint and has not been confirmed by the user.\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [3038eccc-8e40-53be-bda8-1c811e87a855] (Speaker: Agent, Time: 2026-01-02T03:00:00+00:00)\n    *   **Status:** Unresolved. Requires user confirmation to override or clarify the local-storage constraint.\n\n**4. Preferences**\n*   **Language:** Review materials must be in Chinese; English terminology may be retained where appropriate.\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [69ed202d-adcb-5867-93b7-739a1f96a511] (Speaker: 江, Time: 2026-01-01T04:00:00+00:00)\n\n**5. Status & Timeline**\n*   **Current Date:** 2026-01-03\n*   **Target Deadline (Validation):** End of March 2026 (for offline recording-to-text validation).\n*   **Release Date Decision (Unresolved Conflict):**\n    *   **Claim A:** Release date set to April 10, 2026.\n        *   *Evidence ID:* [0e1c4b36-d281-5f5a-8a87-79f5d4a80ee7] (Speaker: 江, Time: 2026-01-02T01:00:00+00:00)\n    *   **Claim B:** Release date set to April 20, 2026.\n        *   *Evidence ID:* [b8f77151-a4ec-5aa6-976e-5722063a66e4] (Speaker: 孙, Time: 2026-01-02T02:00:00+00:00)\n    *   **Status:** Unresolved conflict between 江 and 孙 regarding the release date. No resolution event recorded yet.\n*   **Task Update:** Submit the Haqiao recording prototype by Friday.\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [6ae1f31e-ddd6-5fb4-a3f5-cccfd813a5fa] (Speaker: 江, Time: 2026-01-01T20:00:00+00:00)\n    *   **Assignee:** 江 (Self).\n    *   **Deadline:** Friday.\n*   **Status Change:** The prototype submission was initially marked as completed ([40676b0d-2b0f-5fa9-9a2a-ebee2e5eb923]), but this status is now **retracted**.\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [0a1cf49c-02dd-5997-a0e6-1ee453f72fda] (Speaker: 江, Time: 2026-01-01T22:00:00+00:00)\n    *   **Reason:** Prototype acceptance failed (\"录音原型验收失败\").\n    *   **Resolution:** The task [40676b0d-2b0f-5fa9-9a2a-ebee2e5eb923] is superseded by a new pending action to \"re-open and submit the recording prototype\" (\"重新打开提交录音原型待办\").\n    *   **Current State:** Pending re-submission.\n*   **Historical Context Update:** Offline testing for Haqiao was discussed in the office last week, prior to the current date (2026-01-03).\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [200da07c-78b6-512c-89ab-34afdd5de90e] (Speaker: 江, Time: 2026-01-03T06:00:00+00:00)\n    *   **Note:** This confirms the offline testing topic was active before the current date.\n\n**6. Resolved/Retracted Tasks**\n*   **Brochure Task:** The task to arrange for Haqiao printed brochures ([0f33f136-61a0-5775-bb7d-f08ff8c7e9aa]) was created but subsequently **cancelled**.\n    *   *Evidence ID:* [39d0e0c2-0329-5790-a4b1-d26eac258d0d] (Speaker: 江, Time: 2026-01-02T00:00:00+00:00)\n    *   **Reason:** No longer needed (\"不再需要宣传册\").\n    *   **Action:** Retracts task [0f33f136-61a0-5775-bb7d-f08ff8c7e9aa].\n\n**7. New Facts & Specifications**\n*   **Device Quantity:** The target number of devices for the Haqiao project is 12 units.\n    *  ", "summary_tokens": 1536}